ull,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_SPACE_AVAILABILITY"],"這裡的停車情況如何？",[[[["E:PARKING_SPACE_DIFFICULT_TO_FIND"],"停車不方便",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiGqdib9tmWAxXKHLkGHbtIG8sQ3YcHCLIBKAA"]],1],null,null,"停車位",null,"0ahUKEwiGqdib9tmWAxXKHLkGHbtIG8sQ3IcHCLEBKBU",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_OPTIONS"],"有哪些停車選項？",null,[[[["E:PARKING_OPTION_NO_PARKING"],"不提供停車位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiGqdib9tmWAxXKHLkGHbtIG8sQ3YcHCLQBKAA"]]],null,"附近的停車場",null,"0ahUKEwiGqdib9tmWAxXKHLkGHbtIG8sQ3IcHCLMBKBY",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_TIPS"],"分享停車相關資訊",null,null,"請提供停車場地點和停車位數量等資訊","停車場",null,"0ahUKEwiGqdib9tmWAxXKHLkGHbtIG8sQ3IcHCLUBKBc",null,null,["因在社區大樓的一樓，路邊只有少數機車停車格，汽車附近走一段路有露天付費停車場"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiGqdib9tmWAxXKHLkGHbtIG8sQ3YcHCLcBKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiGqdib9tmWAxXKHLkGHbtIG8sQ3IcHCLYBKBg",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["第一次造訪「初原麵場」，整體用餐體驗很棒！\n\n🍜 雞白湯拉麵\n有三種肉，其中最喜歡炙燒叉燒，香氣十足、厚薄度剛好、不會太肥。湯頭濃郁順口、不過鹹，麵體若想更硬一點可提前告知店家。整碗吃下來真的愛了愛了。\n\n🔥 濃魂爆菜豚骨王拉麵\n多了一匙蒜粒，帶點辣度，喜歡重口味的人會很愛。湯頭一樣濃郁不膩，是那種會想喝光的好味道。\n\n🍗 唐揚雞\n外酥內嫩、調味恰到好處，可圈可點。\n\n🏠 環境與服務\n店內乾淨整潔，內用提供冬瓜檸檬與冰水。用餐後餐具需自助回收，老闆也非常親切有禮。\n\n整體來說是一家誠意滿滿又讓人想回訪的拉麵店，推薦給喜歡濃郁系湯頭又愛喝湯的朋友！",null,[0,30]]]],[],[null,null,8258,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5QlJrbEJaVko0YmtaWlptcFVUVGt4ZUVRM1QwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x4382d31ca9fe1bd0!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOl9BRklBZVJ4bkZZZmpUTTkxeEQ3T0E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5QlJrbEJaVko0YmtaWlptcFVUVGt4ZUVRM1QwRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5QlJrbEJaVko0YmtaWlptcFVUVGt4ZUVRM1QwRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5QlJrbEJaVko0YmtaWlptcFVUVGt4ZUVRM1QwRRILMGN4cWhKcGxLcTkaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sOUJSa2xCWlZKNGJrWlpabXBVVFRreGVFUTNUMEUSCzBj